# Justified exceptions to tools/flaky-patterns.py (#720). One per line:
#   <pattern> <path> <fn-name|*> -- <one-line reason>
# <fn-name> is the innermost named fn around the site; * covers the whole file.
# An entry that matches nothing fails the check.

# store-open: files with no concurrent owner. Nothing else can hold admission,
# so typed storage_busy here would be the test's own ordering, not a peer's.
